# tor.suite — A to Z: two nodes meet on a LAN, one leaves it, and the swarm
# survives over Tor.
#
# Every step is built from nothing in one simulation: the User is bootstrapped,
# the second node is adopted over the LAN, both nodes raise a hidden service,
# node2 withdraws its LAN address entirely, and the link has to re-form over
# the only transport left. Nothing is assumed about the world beforehand,
# which is what makes the last step mean something.
bootstrap-user-software-key
adopt-node
tor-link
